@vendoai/bench:test: 
@vendoai/bench:test: Usage:
@vendoai/bench:test:   pnpm --filter @vendoai/bench demo:pipeline -- --id SLUG --prospect NAME --screenshots /abs/a.png,/abs/b.png [--url https://prospect-site] [--cta-url URL] [--expires 2026-08-31] [--notes notes.md] [--demos-repo /abs/path] [--skip-ship]
@vendoai/bench:test:   pnpm --filter @vendoai/bench demo:fix -- --id SLUG --instruction "<free text>" [--demos-repo /abs/path] [--skip-ship]
@vendoai/bench:test: 
@vendoai/bench:test: demo:pipeline turns the prospect's real product screenshots into a live demo at
@vendoai/bench:test: https://demos.vendo.run/SLUG, in one command: brand evidence (context.dev) →
@vendoai/bench:test: one vision brand-brief → three parallel build agents → host build + a smoke
@vendoai/bench:test: turn → fidelity judge → commit, push and deploy the shared host.
@vendoai/bench:test: The demo itself is a folder in the vendo-demos host repo (--demos-repo, default
@vendoai/bench:test: ~/.vendo/vendo-demos, cloned/pulled automatically) — prospect branding lives
@vendoai/bench:test: there and never in this repo.
@vendoai/bench:test: 
@vendoai/bench:test: demo:fix applies free-text operator feedback to an existing demo with ONE agent,
@vendoai/bench:test: then re-assembles, re-judges and re-ships it.
@vendoai/bench:test: 
@vendoai/bench:test: Needs: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY (the creator harness — brief, judge and the claude CLI
@vendoai/bench:test: agents all ride a provider key), CONTEXT_DEV_API_KEY (brand evidence),
@vendoai/bench:test: VENDO_API_KEY (the host this pipeline BOOTS locally to smoke and screenshot the
@vendoai/bench:test: demo runs the Cloud posture: its store, connections and agent route are
@vendoai/bench:test: Cloud-composed, and the harness key does not stand in for it), the `claude` CLI
@vendoai/bench:test: on PATH, and a logged-in `railway` CLI. None is ever logged.
